    return []"},"evidence_mode":"Researcher-fixed archived diagnostic evidence; no new registration or probe is requested.","family":"planning","historical_metrics":{"development_successes":0,"development_total":8,"prompt_successes":0,"prompt_total":2,"total_successes":0,"total_tasks":10},"historical_observations":[],"max_submissions":1,"n_params":0,"objective":"Maximize successes on the eight development instances; report the two public instances separately. Keeping the same artifact is a legal decision and does not itself count as improvement.","probe_contract":{"claim":"For each named public instance, only ASCII edge-whitespace normalization is sufficient to repair this generated failing plan.","evaluation":"Both versions of the same generated plan use unchanged host syntax checks, VAL when reached, and public STRIPS replay; they are not separately generated plans.","operation":"Generate one plan per public instance; trim ASCII whitespace outside parentheses and at inside payload edges only. Preserve operator/argument tokens, case, internal whitespace, order and count. Never add parentheses or actions.","planning_n_params":"Parameter-count metadata is ignored by the planning executor.","scope":"Only the bound candidate and stated development observations; no held-out, physical-necessity or universal claim.","selection":"One researcher-fixed probe and target per state; registration does not measure autonomous probe selection.","verdicts":{"contradicted":"Original failed and safely normalized plan still fails.","supported":"Original failed and normalized plan succeeds.","unknown":"Original already succeeded, no usable plan, or normalization contract does not apply; unknown is not false."}},"probe_feedback":{"case_id":"P-format","family":"planning","observations":[{"intervention":{"error_kind":null,"plan_length":11,"status":"success"},"original":{"error_kind":"operator_syntax","first_invalid_action":0,"plan_length":11,"status":"invalid_output"},"reason":"edge_normal